# Sample data of the examples and tutorials: tracked although the patterns above match them (on a
# case-insensitive file system *.sp3 also matches .SP3); keep each name explicit.
!/sample_data/COD0MGXFIN_20240340000_01D_05M_ORB.SP3
!/sample_data/COD0MGXFIN_20240350000_01D_05M_ORB.SP3
